{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2022-11-11 16:21:00', 'title': "VENTAS TO PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT NAREIT'S REITWORLD 2022 ANNUAL CONFERENCE", 'text': "CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MANAGEMENT WILL PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT NAREIT'S REITWORLD 2022 ANNUAL CONFERENCE (THE “NAREIT CONFERENCE”) ON NOVEMBER 15-16, 2022."}